{"html": "<div class=\"exhbox\"><div class=\"exhhead\">⚠ 急騰後の失速（出尽くし型）（注意）</div><div class=\"exhwhy\">・10/30に出来高39.1倍の急騰（前日比+25.1%）</div><div class=\"exhwhy\">・翌営業日に続落（買いの続かなさを確認）</div><div class=\"exhwhy\">・急騰日の高値からすでに−20.2%</div><div class=\"discnote\">「材料出尽くし」＝良い発表（上方修正・増配など）で急騰した後、買いたい人が買い終わって利益確定売りに押される現象。値動きと出来高の形からの機械検知・予測であり、必ず下がるという意味ではありません。急騰直後の高値追いは一呼吸置くのが定石です。</div></div><div class=\"nhead\">いまの指標の位置（主要7＋準主要7指標）</div><div class=\"mlegend\"><span style=\"background:#b9dcc0\">安心・標準</span><span style=\"background:#c9dcf3\">魅力あり（要確認）</span><span style=\"background:#f5e6b3\">注意</span><span style=\"background:#f2c4a8\">警戒</span><span style=\"background:#eeeae0\">中立</span></div><div class=\"meters\"><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">RSI(14)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:30.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:30.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:40.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:60.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:70.0%; width:30.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:50.3%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">50</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ボリンジャー</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:16.7%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:16.7%; width:16.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:33.3%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:66.7%; width:16.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:83.3%; width:16.7%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:53.7%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">+0.2σ</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">25日線乖離</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:25.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:25.0%; width:30.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:55.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:75.0%; width:25.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:77.3%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">+0.9%</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">MACD</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:33.3%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:33.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:66.7%; width:33.3%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:16.7%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">下向き</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">50/200日線</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:50.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:50.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:75.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">GC</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">支持帯の試し</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:60.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:60.0%; width:40.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:100.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">9回目</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">20日高値から</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.0%; width:13.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:20.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:53.3%; width:46.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:100.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">−20.2%</span></div><div class=\"msub\">準主要指標（補助的に見る）</div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ストキャス</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:30.0%; width:40.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:70.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:80.0%; width:20.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:34.6%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">35</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">MFI</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:30.0%; width:40.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:70.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:80.0%; width:20.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:24.3%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">24</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ADX(トレンド強さ)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:33.3%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:8.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:41.7%; width:58.3%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:24.2%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">14↑</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">一目・雲</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:33.3%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:33.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:66.7%; width:33.3%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:16.7%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">雲の下</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ATR(日々の値幅)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.0%; width:15.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:35.0%; width:15.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:50.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:80.3%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">8.0%</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">HV(年率変動)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.8%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.8%; width:12.5%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:16.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:50.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:95.5%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">115%</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">OBV(20日)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:40.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:40.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:10.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:60.0%; width:40.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:45.9%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">-4%</span></div></div><div class=\"discnote\">ピンが現在値。PER・PBRなど価値系は「標準」が最も安心、割安は魅力だが「割安の罠」の確認が必要。RSI・ボリンジャーなど行きすぎ系は売られすぎ側が押し目買いに有利。読み方は「指標の読み方」ページへ。</div><div class=\"nhead\">対象外の理由</div><div class=\"reason\">・流動性不足</div><div class=\"nhead\">減点方式: 全体2,744位（−67点）</div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevA\">致命</span>直近10日に1日15%の急落（材料落ち）<span class=\"num hp\">−25</span></div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevB\">重い</span>日々の値動きが±7.5%と荒すぎる<span class=\"num hp\">−12</span></div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevB\">重い</span>売買代金が1日1億円未満（約定しにくい）<span class=\"num hp\">−10</span></div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevB\">重い</span>長期支持帯を9回目に試す位置（割れやすい）<span class=\"num hp\">−8</span></div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevC\">軽い</span>下げが1日に集中（崩落型）<span class=\"num hp\">−6</span></div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevC\">軽い</span>夜間ギャップ平均±2.9%（夜の判断がズレやすい）<span class=\"num hp\">−6</span></div><div class=\"nhead\">アナリスト・コンセンサス（証券会社レーティング）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は現時点で<b>カバレッジ対象外</b>です（証券会社アナリストによる平均評価・平均目標株価の公表データがありません）。レーティングは主に中大型株が対象で、小型株はカバーされないことが多くあります。データが取得でき次第、ここに自動で表示されます。</div><div class=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(12年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"49.3\" width=\"320\" height=\"11.400000000000006\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,87.9 9.1,79.5 14.2,80.6 19.3,67.0 24.5,68.0 29.6,51.3 34.7,69.1 39.8,12.8 44.9,56.6 50.0,64.9 55.1,63.9 60.3,60.7 65.4,62.8 70.5,72.2 75.6,70.1 80.7,70.1 85.8,83.7 91.0,87.9 96.1,87.9 101.2,95.2 106.3,95.2 111.4,96.2 116.5,97.2 121.6,96.2 126.8,97.2 131.9,86.8 137.0,82.6 142.1,36.7 147.2,42.0 152.3,56.6 157.4,48.2 162.6,35.7 167.7,27.4 172.8,35.7 177.9,45.1 183.0,61.8 188.1,49.3 193.2,47.2 198.4,51.3 203.5,56.6 208.6,48.2 213.7,31.5 218.8,39.9 223.9,39.9 229.0,42.0 234.2,44.0 239.3,47.2 244.4,46.1 249.5,56.6 254.6,53.4 259.7,54.5 264.9,51.3 270.0,46.1 275.1,47.2 280.2,50.3 285.3,49.3 290.4,51.3 295.5,55.5 300.7,53.4 305.8,43.0 310.9,74.3 316.0,52.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 99.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#